<title>PHILIPPINES: Liberty Flour spins off realty business.</title>
<headline>Liberty Flour spins off realty business.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Flour Mills Inc said on Thursday its board had approved a plan to assign all its real estate assets to a wholly owned holding company.</p>
<p>The company did not specify which property assets would be spun off but said the plot on which its two factories were located would remain with the parent company.</p>
<p>Liberty also set a 50 centavo cash dividend to shareholders as of December 2, and payable on December 6.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
